cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RYNTARA in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RYNTARA"
abstract: >-
  RYNTARA is a vehicle-independent coordination and runtime safety framework
  for autonomous systems. It takes telemetry from drones and rovers in each
  vehicle's own format, shows the whole fleet live on one map, and checks
  planned routes against redzones and other traffic before they are approved,
  proposing an alternate route when one conflicts. Multi-vehicle coordination
  uses a derived version of PHASE.
